/-!
# A128290

If p(x) is the product of the digits of the number x and s(x) the sum of the digits then the sequence lists all the numbers k for which p(s(k)) = s(p(k)), with k >= 1.

The 57 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A128290

/-- Known terms of `A128290`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 22,
    36, 63, 109, 123, 132, 158, 185, 190, 199, 208,
    213, 231, 280, 289, 298, 307, 312, 321, 333, 370,
    406, 458, 460, 469, 485, 496, 505, 518, 548, 550,
    556, 559, 565, 581, 584, 595, 604, 640, 649, 655,
